&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Release strategy: cut releases, nightly builds, signed updates by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5572104845" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/1" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/1/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/1"&gt;#1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the previous nightly DMG; clarify switching back to Stable by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5572689784" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/2" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/2/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/2"&gt;#2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
